{"info": {"address1": "Engineers India Bhawan", "address2": "1, Bhikaiji Cama Place", "city": "New Delhi", "zip": "110066", "country": "India", "phone": "91 11 2676 2121", "fax": "91 11 2617 8210", "website": "https://www.engineersindia.com", "industry": "Engineering & Construction", "industryKey": "engineering-construction", "industryDisp": "Engineering & Construction", "sector": "Industrials", "sectorKey": "industrials", "sectorDisp": "Industrials", "longBusinessSummary": "Engineers India Limited, an engineering consultancy company, provides design, engineering, procurement, construction, and integrated project management services for oil, gas, fertilizers, steel, railways, power, infrastructure, and petrochemical industries worldwide. The company operates through two segments, Consultancy & Engineering Projects, and Turnkey Projects. It offers supply chain management services, such as supplier/contractor registration, contracting and purchase of goods/services/works, expediting, inspection, and supplier/contractor performance review; and develops process technologies for various industries. In addition, the company provides construction services comprising pre-construction activities, including bid management process, plot plan review/heavy lift study, etc.; and construction services comprising site construction management, liaison with statutory authorities, construction quality and warehouse management, HSE management, contracts administration, pre commissioning and commissioning assistance, and contract and site closing services. Further, it offers heat and mass transfer equipment design, environment engineering, specialist materials and maintenance, specialist materials, and maintenance services and plant operations and safety services; and pre-feed and feed engineering services for a range of processes in the hydrocarbon processing industry. Additionally, the company provides project management, third party inspection, quality assurance, independent engineer and lender's engineer services, and project appraisal and project execution services. It also offers certification, recertification, safety audits for offshore and onshore oil and gas facilities and other qualitative sensitive sectors of the industry. Engineers India Limited was incorporated in 1965 and is headquartered in New Delhi, India.", "fullTimeEmployees": 2650, "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sanjay  Jindal", "age": 57, "title": "Director of Finance, CFO & Executive Director", "yearBorn": 1968, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 7211811, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Rajiv  Agarwal", "title": "Director of Technical & Executive Director", "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 7429703, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Rupesh Kumar Singh", "age": 56, "title": "Director of Human Resource & Additional Executive Director", "yearBorn": 1969, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2094981, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Atul  Gupta", "age": 56, "title": "Director of Commercial and Executive Director", "yearBorn": 1969, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 6924665, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Subhas  Balakumar", "age": 58, "title": "Director of Projects & Executive Director", "yearBorn": 1967, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2724682, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Praveen Mal Khanooja", "title": "Chairman & MD", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Amanpreet Singh Chopra", "title": "General Manager of C&MD Office and Investor Relations", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. S. C. Rai", "title": "Head of Legal Operations and Assistant General Manager", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Suvendu Kumar Padhi